    14	/**
    15	 * Stock reservations for checkout.
    16	 *
    17	 * Every SKU has three counters: `stock` (units on hand), `reserved` (units
    18	 * held for orders that have not been committed) and `sold`. Available stock
    19	 * is `stock - reserved` and must never go below zero.
